        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"//cdn.testbook.com/images/production/quesImages/qImage649abbaf62a55c21c51f4b77.png\" /></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(30, 43, 51);\">∴ A circle can have 2 parallel tangents at most.</span></p>\n\n<p>So, only one parallel tangent is possible for a given tangent.</p>\n",
