    {
      "id": "c1c539efdb46-q10",
      "number": 10,
      "question": "From a point T, a tangent TP at point P, is drawn to a circle with centre O. A secant TQR (point Q is near to point T) is drawn from the point T. ∆PQR is inscribed into the circle by joining the points P, Q and R. Draw lines OQ and OR. If &ang;PTQ is 27&deg; and &ang;TPQ = 55&deg;, what is the degree measure of &ang;ROQ?",
      "questionHtml": "From a point T, a tangent TP at point P, is drawn to a circle with centre O. A secant TQR (point Q is near to point T) is drawn from the point T.&nbsp; ∆PQR is inscribed into the circle by joining the points P, Q and R. Draw lines OQ and OR. If &ang;PTQ is 27&deg; and &ang;TPQ = 55&deg;, what is the degree measure of &ang;ROQ?",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "86",
          "html": "86"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "82",
          "html": "82"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "98",
          "html": "98"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "94",
          "html": "94"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p>∠TQP = 180º - (∠TPQ + ∠PTQ) <span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">⇒ </span>∠TQP = 180º - (55º + 27º) <span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">⇒ </span>∠TQP = 98º</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">⇒ </span><span style=\"font-family: var(--bs-body-font-family); font-size: var(--bs-body-font-size); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">∠ROQ = 2 × ∠TQP </span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">⇒ </span><span style=\"font-family: var(--bs-body-font-family); font-size: var(--bs-body-font-size); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">∠ROQ = 2 × 49º </span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">⇒ </span><span style=\"font-family: var(--bs-body-font-family); font-size: var(--bs-body-font-size); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">∠ROQ = 86º</span></p>\n",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    }
  ]
